sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User A viewer session
    participant B as Dicoogle backend
    participant K as Protected cache-key registry
    participant O as Shared OPFS
    participant C as Crypto and entry validator
    participant R as RAM cache
    participant W as Decoder worker
    participant V as Cornerstone
    U->>B: Open Study X with existing session token
    B->>B: Check permission and current source/key version
    alt Access denied
        B-->>U: Deny; no DEK and no frame processing
    else Access allowed
        B->>K: Get or create scoped cache DEK and key version
        K-->>B: Scoped DEK
        B-->>U: DEK and current descriptor over HTTPS
        U->>C: Install volatile DEK and expected frame context
        U->>O: Read candidate encrypted frame
        alt Entry is present
            O-->>U: Ciphertext, nonce, tag and header
            U->>C: Validate version/context and verify AEAD
            alt Entry invalid or authentication fails
                C-->>U: Reject; do not decode candidate
                U->>O: Invalidate entry
                U->>B: Refetch authorised native frame
                B-->>U: Native frame bytes
            else Entry valid
                C-->>U: Verified plaintext frame bytes
            end
        else Entry absent
            O-->>U: Cache miss
            U->>B: RetrieveFrames request
            B-->>U: Native frame bytes
        end
        U->>R: Store bounded current-session plaintext
        R->>W: Decode native frame
        W-->>U: Decoded image
        U->>U: Check session generation is still active
        U->>V: Publish and render decoded image
        opt Populate or replace persistent entry
            U->>C: Encrypt with fresh nonce and expected-context AAD
            C-->>U: Ciphertext envelope
            U->>O: Lock and publish complete entry/index update
        end
        U->>U: Logout or close study
        U->>U: Invalidate session generation and cancel in-flight work
        U->>R: Clear plaintext references
        U->>W: Reset or terminate managed workers
        U->>V: Purge owned images and dispose viewport
        U->>C: Remove active DEK references
        Note over K,O: Shared ciphertext and protected backend DEK can survive logout
        Note over C,V: Cleanup is not proof of memory or media sanitisation
    end
